# Navigation

- Tab order is **Home · Blogs · Chat · Experience · Contact** and does not change.
- `NativeTabs.Trigger` names: `(home)`, `(blog)`, `(chat)`, `(experience)`, `(contact)`.
- About, Projects, Project detail, Skills, Privacy live **only** in the Home stack. Do not promote one to a tab.
- Router tree is specified in `docs/02-screens.md` §1. Adding a screen means adding it there too.
- Keep `NativeTabs` (D1) — platform-native tab bar; everything above it is brand.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — Skills as a fifth-adjacent tab
<NativeTabs.Trigger name="skills" />

// ✅ GOOD — Skills pushed inside the Home stack
<NativeTabs.Trigger name="(home)" />
// src/app/(tabs)/(home)/skills.tsx
```

Read `docs/02-screens.md` before changing routes. Use the `expo-router` skill.
